OL,3,GNEWSAAdventurer completes 400-mile
OL,4,Aexpedition after losing contact with
OL,5,Ateam
OL,6,
OL,7,FTowards the end of the journey Dykes
OL,8,Flost power to his portable satellite
OL,9,Fkit and said "my parents and fiancee
OL,10,Fwere worrying but as soon as I had a
OL,11,Fbit of signal I made sure I got in
OL,12,Ftouch".
